a</italic>.</article-title><source>Dev Dyn</source><volume>235</volume><fpage>2111</fpage><lpage>2121</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16788967</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000644-Rinkevich4"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rinkevich</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Loya</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><year>1985b</year><article-title>Coral isomone: A proposed chemical signal controlling intraclonal growth patterns in a branching coral.</article-title><source>Bull Mar Sci</source><volume>36</volume><fpage>319</fpage><lpage>324</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000644-Callahan1"><label>33</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Callahan</surname><given-names>HS</given-names></name><name><surname>Pigliucci</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schlichting</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name></person-group><year>1997</year><article-title>Developmental phenotypic plasticity: where ecology and evolution meet molecular biology - Review.</article-title><source>Bioessays</source><volume>19</volume><fpage>519</fpage><lpage>525</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9204769</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000644-Rinkevich5"><label>34</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rinkevich</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Loya</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><year>1984</year><article-title>Coral illumination through an optic glass-fiber: incorporation of 14C photosynthates.</article-title><source>Mar Biol</source><volume>80</volume><fpage>7</fpage><lpage>15</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000644-Abraham1"><label>35</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abraham</surname><given-nam